      "writtenOn": "2021-02-23T03:06:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I agree. But I believe this is only executed in the --invoke-with case. Do we have good tests for that? I don\u0027t want to do this in the present CL. I\u0027ll add it to a list of future cleanups.",
